\" message anymore. (I do run headless export infrequently, which seems to be the culprit)\n1. After day's work, I quit Godot last time and shutdown the computer\n1. Goto step 1 \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Start Godot and load project --> No warning message\n1. Run headless export for the loaded project, in my case: `\"C:\\godot\\Godot_v4.4-stable_mono_win64\\Godot_v4.4-stable_mono_win64_console.exe\" --headless --no-window --export-release \"Windows Desktop\"`\n1. Quit Godot\n1. Start Godot and load project --> BUG: **\"It looks like Godot crashed when opening this project the last time.\"**\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"miv391","id":49998025,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTk4MDI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49998025?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391","html_url":"https://github.com/miv391","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103564/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103564/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}